# Local LLM

Do

- Run the LLM on this machine.
- Treat GitHub as source (optional static frontend host). The Python/LLM app cannot run on GitHub Pages.

Don’t

- Depend on a cloud clone or remote GPU as the default runtime.
- Send chat content to third-party APIs unless the user explicitly asks.
